Add a round-trip test for asymmetric ciphertext with an empty payload

Add a unit test in src/ciphertext that generates a key pair, encrypts an empty
byte slice with `encrypt_asymmetric` using the latest version, decrypts it with
`decrypt_asymmetric`, and asserts the result is empty. Do not change library
code unless the test reveals a bug; if it does, fix the bug and explain it in
the artifact.
